      "releaseNotes": "We’ve expanded health data support by adding body weight, height, BMI, active energy burned, and heart rate insights from Android Health Connect. Eligible Medicare members can now view claims, plan spending details, and ID cards directly in the app. We’ve also enhanced the Haio experience with full chat history on Android, an updated design, and a fix that restores reliable copy functionality on iOS.",
