      "description": "Health100: Your trusted front door to health and care\n\nHealth care should feel connected, not complicated. Health100 brings your eligible health care, pharmacy and benefits together in one modern app so you can stay informed and take action with confidence.\n\nHealth100 puts essential health needs in one place. No switching between systems. No guessing what to do next. Health100 provides a clear, streamlined experience powered by real-time AI insights to help you focus on what matters most: your health.\n\nWith Health100, you can:\nAccess and connect health records, including visit summaries and shared records\nUse AI to get real-time personal health care information\nManage eligible prescriptions and pharmacy services in a simple, unified experience\nSchedule and manage appointments across supported care services\nView and understand eligible benefits information, including claims and coverage details\nStay on track with eligible appointment updates and timely medication reminders\n\nHealth100 brings your trusted services together. Whether you are preparing for a visit with your provider, reviewing your health information or managing medications, Health100 can help you stay connected and in control.\n\nDisclaimer: Not all of your health info may be available in Health100. Availability depends on participating partners and your authorization.",
